ass="Formatted">Everybody Loves Those Swaying Palm Trees.......<br /><br />What a wonderful ending to this series, but not the end of our trips to Hawaii and Hot Hula nights.....<br /><br />Ella Kitt fox shifter and tough as nails soldier travels to Hawaii from Twin Moons Ranch in Arizona to help her old unit teammates with security at Koa Point. What she hadn't expected was to be working with Jake the love of her life, not that anyone knew, it was her secret. That one night they shared back in a war torn land where she discovered he was her mate never left her...But he was human and she would not repeat the tragedy that her mother experienced when she mated with a human. She would keep up her tough veneer and gladly sacrifice her femininity and her love to keep him safe.<br /><br />Jake McBride came back from his last deployment without a purpose, but to find his place in the normal world. He never stopped thinking of Ella though, she was forever ingrained in his heart, but she had made it very clear that it was only one night. Now he finds himself in Hawaii to work security with some of his old unit and lo and behold but the vision that has never left his dreams appears before his eyes.....Can destiny be playing a hand after all, or is some other kind of intervention at play?<br /><br />The team is on high alert as Boone gets ready to meet his offspring, not so grumpy anymore Silas is to marry Cassandra and the mother of all the Jewels makes her appearance to a very unlikely and surprising recipient too.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">6 likes</span></button></div><div class="B