arge" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Being a shifter in a human world is not easy, and being a woman shifter in Special forces, is even harder. When Ella met Jake she knew it couldn´t last, but temptation was too great not to give in, and they had an unforgettable moment together. But Ella knows that her world is no place for a human. <br />Jake couldn´t forget about Ella, and now when he gets his second chance he´s going to do whatever it takes. But is he prepared for what is coming?<br />Working security together has feelings flaring, and can either of them resist the temptation, and keep up the work at the same time? <br />PNR romance, action, smut and fluff in an awesome combo. <br />Love this series! <br />I am voluntarily reviewing a book gifted to me by the author with no obligation.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5104197?shelf=arc-and-or-gifted" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc-and-or-gifted</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">4 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.656