23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2266171766">January 21, 2018</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Lure of the Fox Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart Book 6 <br />by Anna Lowe <br />⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️<br /><br />If you are looking for a fantastic paranormal shifter series to read then this is it. The Aloha Shifters: LURE OF THE FOX! OH MY WORD! What a Phenomenal Story this is to read. This is the continuing saga of the Aloha Shifters. I love the continuity this series offers. Each time I read a book in this series, I absolutely adore and enjoyed everyone of them. Lure of the fox is just another one that's right in line with the others! Plus I know each time I finish one of these books, I don’t think I’ve enjoyed a book so much. I have enjoyed reading every one of Anna Lowe books. I absolutely enjoyed reading about mix shifters it's always so exciting,suspensful and intriguing. This is Ella and Jake's story. As usual Anna creates fun, loving, sexy and fascinating characters. The story is packed with action, suspense, and romance! The story is well written and it's really paced just right, there is a few twists plus it has Dragons, Tigers, Wolves, Bears and Foxes but there is a unique shifter. I always enjoy the world that Anna builds for her characters, plus the way she developes her characters and their story with great depth. I have read a lot of her books and I enjoyed them all very much, they are exciting, suspenseful, captivating. This is the reason why I enjoy her story-telling abilitie and it's why I'm always excited to read her books time and time again! Plus if you are like myself and you enjoy a Phenomenal Paranormal read that will make you LOL and allow you to identify with the characters then you will enjoy this book as much as I did. You will also be as anxious as I am to read the next book she writes. I highly recommend you read this book and the others in the series. Believe me when I say you won't be disappointed you will absolutely enjoy reading every one of them.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27383555?shelf=exciting-and-entertaining" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">exciting-and-entertaining</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27383555?shelf=phenomenal" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">phenomenal</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">3 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,1