ved every second.<br /><br />Ella and Jake’s story is full of sacrifice, love, steamy sexy times and lots of danger. Ella has known that Jake is her mate since they first met. But Ella is a fox shifter and Jake is a human with no clue that shifters exist. Both were part of an elite military force and faced danger and each other often. Yet Ella managed to avoid anything personal with Jake except for one amazing night that neither can ever forget. She walked away, it was one night that she allowed herself no more. For Ella is holding on to a fear that to claim Jake as her mate might well kill him – and that she cannot risk, not even for their own shared happiness. But the fates or perhaps, brothers-in-arms have different plans for these two and both will end up at Koa Point to face another danger… and each other.<br /><br />Lure of the Fox is fast paced, dangerous moments full of twists and turns that you may not see coming right at you. We’ll meet up with all of our shifters in this story, welcome a few changes in their lives, and face down a new danger that has fol owed them from across the world. I don’t want to give anything away for this is a closing story that you should experience first hand yourself. You’ll love every moment of it.<br /><br />There are a few surprises at the ending of this story… but I’ll let you discover what those are. I’ve loved Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart and I’m looking forward to what Ms Lowe brings us next.<br /><br />I read this title through my Kindle Unlimited subscription.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=paranormal-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=series" class="Button Button--tag Button--med