ody3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2246212649">January 6, 2018</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Ella, a fox shifter, is in Hawaii, visiting her friends and former teammates, to help them with a current assignment. She knows she won't be working alone, but she never expected who her partner would be...her mate.<br /><br />Jake, former military, has been struggling since tragically losing some of this teammates. He knows, in order to reunite with the woman he loves, that he needs to be the man he once was.<br /><br />Jake and Ella had given in to their explosive chemistry a couple years ago, and neither have been able to move on, nor had they tried, or forgotten what they'd shared. While Jake has his own reason for staying away for now, Ella's are more permanent, even as her soul aches to be with Jake. She'd watched her mom suffer when the man she loved failed to survive the change, and Ella refuses to lose Jake the same way. So she pushed him away, breaking both their hearts in the process.<br /><br />However, now that they're in close proximity again, Jake knows the time is right to show Ella they belong together. Unfortunately, there's quite a few challenges in store for them along the journey to HEA.<br /><br />Can Jake and Ella solve the case? What happens when Jake learns what Ella, and the others, can do? Will Ella risk changing Jake? Will she have a choice? Will they get the future they've both always wanted?<br /><br />One-click now and follow along as two people, destined to be together, find their way back to one another and decide whether their love can overcome all obstacles.<br /><br />Also, there is a short bonus story featuring Jake and Ella as they begin their lives together.<br /><br />**I volun