="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Long time fan of Anna Lowe ever since I first discovered her work on Kindle Unlimited, and this book doesn't fall away from my expectations. In it you have a heart heavy fox shifter, who under the guise of their world, has discovered that her fated mate if as of now a human. While more women survive the claiming bite, men tend to fight against it and not survive. So she is bound and determined to stay away from Jake in order to save his life, even though knowing she could never be happy.<br /><br />Jake Mcbride has answered the call of some of his former soldiers, that have a way to ease him into civilian life. They have hired him as being extra security for several events that they have coming up. When he arrives, finds him paired up with Ella, a one-night stand he could not get out of his mind. She gives him the cold shoulder even as they work together, and they try their best to get the job done that they were brought in for.<br /><br />Will these two ever find their way to happiness, or will Ella manage to keep her own mind about not claiming him? They run into a lot of things while on the island, and maybe the answer if one you don't see coming. Read the book and find out what happens. If you haven't read the previous books, they aren't needed but i found it nice to have some of the backstory for the other couples that feature in the book.<br /><br />I was given an advanced copy of this book by the author, under no obligation to her, but wanted to get my thoughts on the book out to any readers looking for a good read.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container">