6521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2242531727">January 4, 2018</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Title:  Lure of the Fox  #6<br />Series: Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart<br />Release Date: #AlreadyReleased<br />Author: Anna Lowe<br />Reviewer: Ingrid Stephanie Jordan <br />Serial: Standalone, No Cliffhanger  <br />#PRN #DragonWolfBearTigerFoxShifters  ⚡Book- #5Stars🌟⭐🌟🌟🌟<br />⚡Series- #100Stars🌟⭐🌟🌟🌟×20<br />••••••••••••••<br /> Happy New Year to Ms. Anna who has written another phenomenal book! It captivates you from the first page, to the last page that's full of magic and your dream boyfriends. Notice I said BOYFRIENDS there is a lot of hunks of this book. Definitely a Must Read!<br /> Finally after a long wait Ella Kitt who is a Fox Shifter has come to help the Clan or is it Pack at Koa Point. Many Year's ago Ella found her mate but let him go. She knew she'd get him killed so it's better to walk away, or was it? Fate was working against Ella soon she'll be fighting the bad guy and her emotions. Which one is harder to deal with for this Warrior?<br /> Jake McBride is a human who was in the military when he first met a group of Special Forces, eighteen months ago. There was one night of heaven and they all went there own ways. Now Jake is going to work with the same group of Special Forces Vets in Hawaii. Guess whose there too? Yep his one night of heaven he never forgot.<br />     A copy of this book was provided to me with no requirements for a review. I voluntarily read this book and my comments here are my honest opinion.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z M8,11 L6,11 C5.44771525,11 5,11.4477153 5,12 L5,17 C5,17.5522847 5.44771525,18 6,18 L8,18 C8.552284