ach has a past that haunts them and both care deeply for each other. Ella refuses to face the fact that human charismatic gorgeous Jake is her destiny due to her shifter status. The shifters are in dire need of more security on Koa Point and ask Jake and Ella for help. Thrown together on a secret mission Ella must decide if they are better together or apart.<br /><br />EXCITING-INTOXICATING page-turner story that seized my full attention until the fabulous conclusion. I so love the full cast of characters; their banter and camaraderie. Jake and Ella are certainly a force and their romance is definitely convincing; adored them together. If you enjoy shifter romance with suspense and action this is definitely a fantastic book for your library. I found this to be a most entertaining read and I enjoyed it so much {I voluntarily reviewed an advanced copy.} Without reservations, I recommend this read.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16