her back. Each in the series , the shifter recognizes their mate right away . <br />This lady in the series Anna throws us a loop with a female shifter. <br />Heroine is Ella , the fox shifter. Hero is Jake. Both Ella and Jake have had one night together while serving. Ella knew that Jake was her mate but ...... Jake didn’t want to have a life , a shifters life . After they are let go from the service Ella goes back with the other shifters. Silas and the other shifters have one thing they need to finish . All the shifters thought there was only 5 stones to find , now they know there are 6 magical stones . That’s where Silas ( first in the series ) and the rest call in Jake . Jake served with them so they know him real well . The rest of the shifters decide to also play matchmaker, throw Ella and Jake together and hopefully Mother Earth will show both of them the way . <br />Grab the story and find out do they find the last of the stones , does Jake finally decide to claim Ella .<br /><br />Kelsey Performance for this audio was great, voice is smooth, strong and smooth. like the rest of the series <br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19