catedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">￼<br /><br />Searchyour account<br /><br />Lure of the Fox (Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart) (Volume 6)<br /><br />Lure of the Fox(Aloha Shifters)By Anna Lowe<br /><br />BySandy Brazzelon January 5, 2018<br /><br />As always with Anna Lowe you get a well written, steamy romance with an excellent story and characters that make you wish they were real. If you have not read any other of the Aloha Shifter books, you get an exotic paradise as the location! But the real story is this group of exmilitary heros, and adding Ella heroines, keeping thing safe, finding the stones that bring supernatural power, finding love and standing strong. This is Ella and Jake's story. Ella is a fox shifter, Jake is a sexy military man she has severed several missions with, and one mission lead to one night of sexy fun that can never be repeated, or can it! Human Alpha males don't always survive the mating bite of a female shifter, so Ella won't tell Jake he is her mate, but this book is about Destiny and she will not be denied. So danger lurks, they stand Gaurd, but someone will not be happy till Jake is dead, and old enemies are still circling. Destiny is at play.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.011203