eview","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.et0iNj1jAuRaPqSrwZAHCg","creator":{"__ref":"User:27383555"},"recommendFor":"Everyone ","updatedAt":1519980551419,"createdAt":1516511276194,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1516511449252,"text":"Lure of the Fox Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart Book 6 \u003cbr /\u003eby Anna Lowe \u003cbr /\u003e⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf you are looking for a fantastic paranormal shifter series to read then this is it. The Aloha Shifters: LURE OF THE FOX! OH MY WORD! What a Phenomenal Story this is to read. This is the continuing saga of the Aloha Shifters. I love the continuity this series offers. Each time I read a book in this series, I absolutely adore and enjoyed everyone of them. Lure of the fox is just another one that's right in line with the others! Plus I know each time I finish one of these books, I don’t think I’ve enjoyed a book so much. I have enjoyed reading every one of Anna Lowe books. I absolutely enjoyed reading about mix shifters it's always so exciting,suspensful and intriguing. This is Ella and Jake's story. As usual Anna creates fun, loving, sexy and fascinating characters. The story is packed with action, suspense, and romance! The story is well written and it's really paced just right, there is a few twists plus it has Dragons, Tigers, Wolves, Bears and Foxes but there is a unique shifter. I always enjoy the world that Anna builds for her characters, plus the way she developes her characters and their story with great depth. I have read a lot of her books and I enjoyed them all very much, they are exciting, suspenseful, captivating. This is the reason why I enjoy her story-telling abilitie and it's why I'm always excited to read her books time and time again! Plus if you are like myself and you enjoy a Phenomenal Paranormal read that will make you LOL and allow you to identify with the characters then you will enjoy this book as much as I did. You will also be as anxious as I am to read the next book she writes. I highly recommend you read this book and the others in the series. Believe me when I say you won't be disappointed you will absolutely enjoy reading every one of them.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1NZZ3AK63D7ZY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:51445402":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":51445402,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1452622043i/51445402.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13,"textReviewsCount":384,"name":"Jennifer Scarn","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/51445402-jennifer-scarn","contributor":null,"id":51445402},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/51445402?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2244604976"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.al3wrcGK0Xij9loV5v0-vA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.al3wrcGK0Xij9loV5v0-vA","creator":{"__ref":"User:51445402"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1519980560897,"createdAt":1515178297799,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515178873502,"text":"Ella is easily one of my favorite characters Anna Lowe has written. I love that she’s this tough, determined woman who doesn’t define her feminism in what is considered a classic way. She’s tatted and more comfortable in military fatigues than a dress, not that she can’t totally rock a dress. The heart of her feminism lies in her soul and her ferocity. As for Jake, there is nothing sexier than a man who can stand by a strong woman and not feel the need to prove his masculinity. Jake has some weakness but in that he shows he’s a real man by understanding that he’s stronger with Ella and his team. I enjoyed this immensely and it was a fantastic end to the series. Once again we focus on the stones and in this finale we finally get to see the stones unite. It’s also wonderful to get a glimpse at all of the other couples. This was exciting and sweet with just the right amount of angst. Loved it! I got an earlier version and this is what I truly thought of it. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3PTR2U8P4O6L6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:2812792":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2812792,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1454310245i/2812792.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":398,"name":"Belinda","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2812792-belinda","contributor":null,"id":2812792},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1KKJNXUCP13O0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KKJNXUCP13O0"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ltO51cRD1w8z4xeG3iTqSQ":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ltO51cRD1w8z4xeG3iTqSQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KKJNXUCP13O0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"k