ne night Ella lets her guard down and has a very steamy night with Jake but afterwards can’t commit to him and the parts ways only to meet up on Maui for a protection job on Kao point. \u003cbr /\u003eI’ve been dying to read/listen to Ella’s story for months. You know very little about her at start but each book previously teases you with a new titbit. I absolutely loved this whole book and I did try and pace myself but that did not happen I listen to it in half a day and then had to wait to write this review because I was gutted the series had ended. \u003cbr /\u003eFantastic narration from Kelsey Osborne especially been able to express each very different character individually. \u003cbr /\u003eLooking forward to checking out more audiobooks by Anna Lowe especially the spin of series which I think is Pearls of Desire. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17D0E2SYHCOW5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:155683645":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":155683645,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1767693249i/155683645._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":11,"name":"Zivot_v_knihovne","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/155683645-zivot-v-knihovne","contributor":null,"id":155683645},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AB18B5IDOR7MK":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AB18B5IDOR7MK"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.BcewEgpyFO8E1VOb":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.BcewEgpyFO8E1VOb"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AB18B5IDOR7MK\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.BcewEgpyFO8E1VOb\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AB18B5IDOR7MK","id":"kca: