"Tag","name":"strong-sexual-content","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=strong-sexual-content"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2254191662"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.vtwrfnLz1j6cvXH_OKbzYA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.vtwrfnLz1j6cvXH_OKbzYA","creator":{"__ref":"User:27349116"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1519980574471,"createdAt":1515726095897,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515726143204,"text":"\u003ca href=\"http://www.shifterhaven.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eReviewed at Shifter Haven\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Fox is one of those stories that brings with it a lot of emotional baggage. On one side of the coin, we finally get Ella’s story. She’s been a part of this series from the beginning, even if we didn’t see her often. The other side of that emotional coin is that this story brings the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the heart series to a close. And that is something I really didn’t want to face just yet. There are some series where I get emotionally attached to the characters I’ve come to think of as friends. After all, I’ve lived their lives right along beside them, the good, the bad and the amazing. So, yeah, I get invested in some series more than others. Truth be told, I’m really going to miss this group of shifters who not only gave me some amazing adventures but allowed me to go back down memory lane with the parallel world of Magnum, P.I. It’s been a blast so a huge thank you goes to Anna Lowe for creating such a beautiful world to allow me to get lost in for a while. I’ve loved every second.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eElla and Jake’s story is full of sacrifice, love, steamy sexy times and lots of danger. Ella has known that Jake is her mate since they first met. But Ella is a fox shifter and Jake is a human with no clue that shifters exist. Both were part of an elite military force and faced danger and each other often. Yet Ella managed to avoid anything personal with Jake except for one amazing night that neither can ever forget. She walked away, it was one night that she allowed herself no more. For Ella is holding on to a fear that to claim Jake as her mate might well kill him – and that she cannot risk, not even for their own shared happiness. But the fates or perhaps, brothers-in-arms have different plans for these two and both will end up at Koa Point to face another danger… and each other.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Fox is fast paced, dangerous moments full of twists and turns that you may not see coming right at you. We’ll meet up with all of our shifters in this story, welcome a few changes in their lives, and face down a new danger that has fol owed them from across the world. I don’t want to give anything away for this is a closing story that you should experience first hand yourself. You’ll love every moment of it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere are a few surprises at the ending of this story… but I’ll let you discover what those are. I’ve loved Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart and I’m looking forward to what Ms Lowe brings us next.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI read this title through my Kindle Unlimited subscription.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:7297738":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7297738,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1515203180i/7297738._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":143,"name":"Colleen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7297738-colleen","contributor":null,"id":7297738},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7297738?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2250033488"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tGd_9Fcd5kIU0M_Xa1ll8A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tGd_9Fcd5kIU0M_Xa1ll8A","creator":{"__ref":"User:7297738"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1519980582164,"createdAt":1515466568435,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515468576799,"text":"And so we come full circle, but this time, not so much like \"Magnum, PI,\" because we don't have a heartbreaking episode with Magnum narrating about his own death and such, where you realize that he's been looking back on his life this whole time... [cue the tears] No, what we have is Ella, the woman who sent Tessa to Maui in the first \"Aloha Shifters\" book, and started us down this fantastic path to begin with.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShe was the one who saved Tessa from the clutches of a dark and heartless Dragon, putting her on the path to her Fated Mate and the first Spirit Stone. Every so often, we've heard whispers of her in other books - enough to make us wonder about her - but finally Ella gets a story of her own!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJust when we think that all 5 Stones have been found, we learn that there's one more Stone out there, more power than the rest. Our brave band of Shifters can't relax and enjoy their Happily Ever Afters quiet yet, but they're going to need some help to prepare for the final battle to come, and that's where Ella comes in.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere's no question as to whom Silas will call for help, of course. Ella served with them overseas, and she's a fellow Shifter. But with one of the females heavily pregnant, he has to bring in TWO extra hands, not just one. What's a Type A Alpha Dragon to do?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEnter Jake McBride. He may not be a Shifter, but he's a decorated Army Ranger, he's served with them before. The men of Koa Point all agree it's the perfect plan, especially since they've all witnessed Ella's hot-and-heavy sleep-talking sessions about Jake more than once. Being happily mated themselves, they decide it's all in brotherly \"good fun\" to pair these two up...\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhich of course is a fun, recipe for disaster-type plot-point. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTake 1 uber-strong magic gem\u003cbr /\u003eAdd 1 power-hungry female dragon in a fake-marriage plot,\u003cbr /\u003eThen Shake liberally with an evil psycho-villain\u003cbr /\u003eCrank the temp up to steam with love scenes between 2 amazing Heroes (cool off with ice cubes, as needed)\u003cbr /\u003eSpike with adrenaline,\u003cbr /\u003eAd a dash of________\u003cbr /\u003eGarnish with an adorable calico kitten\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat? Did you think I'd give you the ENTIRE recipe? Where's the fun in that? Read it and fill in your favorite ingredients yourself.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUVY3KSCYOOSB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:29345830":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":29345830,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":524,"name":"Terry","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/29345830-terry","contributor":null,"id":29345830},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29345830?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2247384556"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ghCUqUE8-4IutoHqGH6wrw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ghCUqUE8-4IutoHqGH6wrw","creator":{"__ref":"User:29345830"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1519980583582,"createdAt":1515328708979,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515331639199,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eEndless love\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCan it be the special forces that Ella belonged to so long ago which includes two of her brothers trying to play matchmaker or do they know something their not telling? Ella has known the second she laid eyes on Jake he was her mate but not many men accept the change and as he didn't want that life. She figured they would have that one night together while in the fields and what a night. So much more she talked in her sleep calling out his name. Hence the idea. They think they are slick. Plus they are all mated up. Even Silas their team leader was getting married. Jake never stopped thinking about Ella. One night was not enough he wanted forever but at the time he garnered. They were both just doing their jobs and crossing paths whenever assignments permitted. He knew she always wanted to be treated equal so he made sure his squad treated her like she was 6'2minus 10...too cute. Well one last mission, infiltrate the hotel where Silas is having reception and seek out the people who out for them. On a side note he also has to be watchful because someone is gunning for his old unit as well. Something to do with a mission. Oh did I mention they had to pose as newlyweds. That's right theyz married now for realz. Aww don't worry you can just get a divorce after the assignment forget about an annulment cuz you know you can't have hanky panky. And they are pretty much got that covered in spades. Come along and check out this adventure, of strength, love, animals behavior, self sacrifices and what the power of a smoother of the gem stones can do and a stick. Yeah I said a stick. This story was like \"you had me at hello.\" A must read. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41882678":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41882678,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1633159711i/41882678._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":14,"textReviewsCount":903,"name":"Diana Page","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41882678-diana-page","contributor":null,"id":41882678},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA