name":"series","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=series"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"shifters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=shifters"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"suspense","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=suspense"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2999501252"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uTPmI_yJmv-krVTudO2WDw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uTPmI_yJmv-krVTudO2WDw","creator":{"__ref":"User:13055353"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1570471267429,"createdAt":1570471246185,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1570471267158,"text":"I wasn’t expecting Ella to have her own story as she was very much a background character but I’m certainly glad she did. This book really is the last book in the series and centres around Ella and Jake. Ella was not only with the Koa Point shifters in the military but she was also the foster sister of Kai and Hunter and whilst Jake is human, his military unit also served with the shifter’s unit so they know he is as tough as is humanly possible. What they don’t know however, is that Ella and Jake had one night of passion the previous year in which Jake fell in love and Ella learnt that he was her mate! A mate Ella tells herself she can’t have because of him being unlikely to survive the transition into shifter.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story starts with the shifters needing extra security at Koa Point and especially with the upcoming nuptials of Silas and Cassandra at the upmarket Kapa’akea Resort… a necessity since Silas was the most eligible bachelor on Maui and so they ask Ella to return to the estate, which she does with no questions asked. They also offer Jake some work as part of their security team and both he and Ella are thrust together again which causes them both emotional angst. Just when Ella thinks it can’t get any worse, Kai also comes up with the undercover story of Ella and Jake being on their honeymoon at the resort so they can stake it out security wise. \u003cbr /\u003eBecause she can’t think of a valid reason why they shouldn’t, Ella finds herself ‘married’ to her mate whilst still trying to rebuff him. For his part, Jake is only left confused by Ella blowing hot and cold but being ever the gentlemen that he is, he lets Ella call the shots. In the meantime, he is trying to work out what is happening to the guys in his former military unit since they left the service and whether it will impact on him.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe learn that Moira is still obsessed with the Koa Point shifters hence the reason for the extra security, we meet a new and rather unusual shifter and Nina has her twins… which bizarrely leads to a make or break time for Ella and Jake.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am voluntarily reviewing this book, gifted to me by the author with no obligation.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EII3HFIV6BD0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5907240":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":5907240,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1499301095i/5907240._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":55,"textReviewsCount":2888,"name":"Shayay","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/5907240-shayay","contributor":null,"id":5907240},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5907240?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2191583644"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EaImNFN52BqSV8T-GuuHSg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EaImNFN52BqSV8T-GuuHSg","creator":{"__ref":"User:5907240"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515139306530,"createdAt":1511327351000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515072297000,"text":"\u003cbr /\u003eLove this series! I've read all the books of this series, and have loved them all! Love the overall premise of the series with the magical jewels, and love seeing the different types of shifters find their mates! I'd definitely start with the first book in the series because there's a story throughout all the books and you'll have a better idea about the events in this books. I suppose it isn't completely necessary because this one does focus on a different couple, but I think it enhances to overall story. Plus, all the books are awesome! In this book, Ella, a fox shifter, is in Hawaii to help some of her old soldier buddies help with security now that they've all found their mates and need to protect them and their magical jewels. The group also hires another military buddy, Jake, who just a plain ole human. Ella and Jake have history of the romantic kind. Ella knows Jake is her mate, but since he's human, Ella fears that he probably wouldn't survive the change. Also, she doesn't know how he'd take learning about shifters. There's also some baddies after the group, but also someone isn't too happy with Jake either, and that causes problems. When Jake and Ella need to work closely together, Ella is finding it difficult to keep her emotions in check around Jake. The romance is very sweet, and I loved how devoted Jake is to Ella. They really get each other, and complement each other wonderfully. As always, I love the action! And love the sexy times and mate connections! I'm really looking forward to reading more books set in this setting, and looking forward to more from Anna Lowe!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2P3CD91TS5H4H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:18044929":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":18044929,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1362421663i/18044929.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":156,"textReviewsCount":1954,"name":"Elizabeth Neal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/18044929-elizabeth-neal","contributor":null,"id":18044929},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"celibate-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=celibate-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"celibate-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=celibate-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"hero-celibate-during-separation","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=hero-celibate-during-separation"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"heroine-celibate-during-separation","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=heroine-celibate-during-separation"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"no-om-or-ow-scenes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=no-om-or-ow-scenes"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"no-om-ow-drama","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=no-om-ow-drama"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"safety-gang-approved","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=safety-gang-approved"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"second-chance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=second-chance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2246212649"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LfHTUfqbU9BrsZijIiED7A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LfHTUfqbU9BrsZijIiED7A","creator":{"__ref":"User:18044929"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515301017661,"createdAt":1515264729000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515264811000,"text":"Ella, a fox shifter, is in Hawaii, visiting her friends and former teammates, to help them with a current assignment. She knows she won't be working alone, but she never expected who her partner would be...her mate.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake, former military, has been struggling since tragically losing some of this teammates. He knows, in order to reunite with the woman he loves, that he needs to be the man he once was.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake and Ella had given in to their explosive chemistry a couple years ago, and neither have been able to move on, nor had they tried, or forgotten what they'd shared. While Jake has his own reason for staying away for now, Ella's are more permanent, even as her soul aches to be with Jake. She'd watched her mom suffer when the man she loved failed to survive the change, and Ella refuses to lose Jake the same way. So she pushed him away, breaking both their hearts in the process.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, now that they're in close proximity again, Jake knows the time is right to show Ella they belong together. Unfortunately, there's quite a few challenges in store for them along the journey to HEA.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCan Jake and Ella solve the case? What happens when Jake learns what Ella, and the others, can do? Will Ella risk changing Jake? Will she have a choice? Will they get the future they've both always wanted?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOne-click now and follow along as two people, destined to be together, find their way back to one another and decide whether their love can overcome all obstacles.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlso, there is a short bonus story featuring Jake and Ella as they begin their lives together.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e**I voluntarily read and reviewed an Advanced Reader Copy of this book.**","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:33002272":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":33002272,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1405171665i/33002272.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":62,"name":"Lynda Sliger","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/33002272-lynda-sliger","contributor":null,"id":33002272},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33002272?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2249833929"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.lLHjTecfl8rWS2BRcVkUNQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.lLHjTecfl8rWS2BRcVkUNQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:33002272"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515456978842,"createdAt":1515456941059,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515456978166,"text":"Long time fan of Anna Lowe ever since I first discovered her work on Kindle Unlimited, and this book doesn't fall away from my expectations. In it you have a heart heavy fox shifter, who under the guise of their world, has discovered that her fated mate if as of now a human. While more women survive the claiming bite, men tend to fight against it and not survive. So she is bound and determined to stay away from Jake in order to save his life, even though knowing she could never be happy.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake Mcbride has answered the call of some of his former soldiers, that have a way to ease him into civilian life. They have hired him as being extra security for several events that they have coming up. When he arrives, finds him paired up with Ella, a one-night stand he could not get out of his mind. She gives him the cold shoulder even as they work together, and they try their best to get the job done that they were brought in for.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWill these two ever find their way to happiness, or will Ella manage to keep her own mind about not claiming him? They run into a lot of things while on the island, and maybe the answer if one you don't see coming. Read the book and find out what happens. If you haven't read the previous books, they aren't needed but i found it nice to have some of the backstory for the other couples that feature in the book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was given an advanced copy of this book by the author, under no obligation to her, but wanted to get my thoughts on the book out to any readers looking for a good read.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27978578":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27978578,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1598392270i/27978578._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":29,"textReviewsCount":2128,"name":"Tammy Moldovan","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27978578-tammy-moldovan","contributor":null,"id":27978578},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27978578?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6001007135"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-3E31SAAKzltNm0T5_lCiw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-3E31SAAKzltNm0T5_lCiw","creator":{"__ref":"User:27978578"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1701017068295,"createdAt":1701016319882,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1701017068112,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eLove, mystery and danger\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Ella and Jake’s destined mates, human-shifter, fake marriage, romance with a side of past trauma. The story is filled with all the emotions, the connections and the love. Jake is a human who recently was discharged from the military and is feeling a bit unmoored and having difficulty settling into civilian life. Ella is a fox shifter who also recently retired from the military. While they were still active duty and on a joint exercise, they shared one steamy night together. Jake knows nothing about shifters although he’s heard a few fantastical made up stories. Ella recognized Jake as her fated mate but her past trauma meant she decided to fight fate and walked away. When Jake and Ella are both hired by friends to help with security for Koa Point, a Hawaiian estate where five former military men and their mates live, it gets harder to fight fate and ignore the call of the mate bond and that is before they need to go undercover as newlyweds on their honeymoon. To get to their HEA, they will have to some baggage unpacking and truth telling in order to deal with their painful pasts while dogging bad guys with evil plots, of course. The story was well written and included witty dialogue, three dimensional characters, good world building, and an engaging storyline as shown through sweet moments, steamy scenes, fighting, dangerous situations, shifter physiology and cultures, evil actors, henchmen, loyal friends and family, painful pasts, mystery, revelations, plot twists, big feels, and laughs.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:30841473":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":30841473,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1591029639i/30841473._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":25,"textReviewsCount":1862,"name":"Ingrid Stephanie Jordan","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/30841473-ingrid-stephanie-jordan","contributor":null,"id":30841473},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/30841473?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2242531727"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.8JcK9s2QMPsVOJaArEn9MQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.8JcK9s2QMPsVOJaArEn9MQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:30841473"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515081600513,"createdAt":1515081541348,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515081598784,"text":"Title:  Lure of the Fox  #6\u003cbr /\u003eSeries: Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart\u003cbr /\u003eRelease Date: #AlreadyReleased\u003cbr /\u003eAuthor: Anna Lowe\u003cbr /\u003eReviewer: Ingrid Stephanie Jordan \u003cbr /\u003eSerial: Standalone, No Cliffhanger  \u003cbr /\u003e#PRN #DragonWolfBearTigerFoxShifters  ⚡Book- #5Stars🌟⭐🌟🌟🌟\u003cbr /\u003e⚡Series- #100Stars🌟⭐🌟🌟🌟×20\u003cbr /\u003e••••••••••••••\u003cbr /\u003e Happy New Year to Ms. Anna who has written another phenomenal book! It captivates you from the first page, to the last page that's full of magic and your dream boyfriends. Notice I said BOYFRIENDS there is a lot of hunks of this book. Definitely a Must Read!\u003cbr /\u003e Finally after a long wait Ella Kitt who is a Fox Shifter has come to help the Clan or is it Pack at Koa Point. Many Year's ago Ella found her mate but let him go. She knew she'd get him killed so it's better to walk away, or was it? Fate was working against Ella soon she'll be fighting the bad guy and her emotions. Which one is harder to deal with for this Warrior?\u003cbr /\u003e Jake McBride is a human who was in the military when he first met a group of Special Forces, eighteen months ago. There was one night of heaven and they all went there own ways. Now Jake is going to work with the same group of Special Forces Vets in Hawaii. Guess whose there too? Yep his one night of heaven he never forgot.\u003cbr /\u003e     A copy of this book was provided to me with no requirements for a review. I voluntarily read this book and my comments here are my honest opinion.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42796611":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42796611,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1432367484i/42796611.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":37,"textReviewsCount":1296,"name":"Sherill","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42796611-sherill","contributor":null,"id":42796611},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42796611?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2233652333"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pcJ9tB7yNXk9j6cD5lTIRA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pcJ9tB7yNXk9j6cD5lTIRA","creator":{"__ref":"User:42796611"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1514692430910,"createdAt":1514687230000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1514690241000,"text":"FIERY ROMANCE - MYSTERY - DANGER\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTHRILLING read that lures you to enchanting Koa Point in Maui where special force shifters live in secret keeping the residents safe from harm. This story is filled with gripping suspense, action, mystery, picturesque/dynamic vivid scene descriptions, horrific danger, life-threatening/emotional moments, intense fiery romance and a most rewarding happy ever after.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake and Ella met in the military and had a blissful one night together. Each has a past that haunts them and both care deeply for each other. Ella refuses to face the fact that human charismatic gorgeous Jake is her destiny due to her shifter status. The shifters are in dire need of more security on Koa Point and ask Jake and Ella for help. Thrown together on a secret mission Ella must decide if they are better together or apart.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEXCITING-INTOXICATING page-turner story that seized my full attention until the fabulous conclusion. I so love the full cast of characters; their banter and camaraderie. Jake and Ella are certainly a force and their romance is definitely convincing; adored them together. If you enjoy shifter romance with suspense and action this is definitely a fantastic book for your library. I found this to be a most entertaining read and I enjoyed it so much {I voluntarily reviewed an advanced copy.} Without reservations, I recommend this read.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:30896044":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":30896044,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1642831401i/30896044._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":47,"textReviewsCount":5475,"name":"Jamoz23","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/30896044-jamoz23","contributor":null,"id":30896044},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/30896044?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2234047274"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9p3ou7ST83rFHta9-rLNqg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.9p3ou7ST83rFHta9-rLNqg","creator":{"__ref":"User:30896044"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1514778427004,"createdAt":1514708834000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1514709434000,"text":"Another great story in this series that finally gives us Ella’s story. The fact her mate is a fellow soldier from the days the shifters of Koa Point served in the forces is a lovely twist.\u003cbr /\u003eElla has been a part of this series since book one though we have never met her. She is one of the boys and a respected member of their elite forces team.\u003cbr /\u003eJake was also in the military and knows all the guys from Koa Point but does not know about shifters.\u003cbr /\u003eLoved the way this story unfolded with interesting things happening and at the same time we learn more about the childhood past of Ella, Boone and Hunter.\u003cbr /\u003eLoved how the Keystone come into Jakes possession and how he found it. It will be really interesting to see what happens if the stones need to be used against Moira.\u003cbr /\u003eElla and Jake dance around each other for ages before they start to see they are meant to be. It takes a serious incident for Ella to see they are meant to be together.\u003cbr /\u003eSo sad about what happened to Ella’s mum and Brian, no wonder she was running afraid of mating Jake.\u003cbr /\u003eThe baddie Goode was unique and I am very happy with what happened to him.\u003cbr /\u003eThe ending with everyone at Koa Point together for Cassandra and Silas’ wedding was so heart-warming and sweet.\u003cbr /\u003eLoved having memories of our holiday in Hawaii refreshed.\u003cbr /\u003eThis is my honest review of this book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:3599278":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":3599278,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":12,"textReviewsCount":556,"name":"Robin","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3599278-robin","contributor":null,"id":3599278},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/3599278?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2261154569"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gBJDnWPeSlVJdvb4n06xAQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gBJDnWPeSlVJdvb4n06xAQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:3599278"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1516172137724,"createdAt":1516171292368,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1516172137023,"text":"Well now we have the stunning conclusion as all the jewels have been found. It was awesome yet sad because it marks the end of the Aloha Shifters at least for now if I understood the references to pearls properly.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI damn near cried seeing Ella the fox shifter let her softer feminine side show. Jake a big burly ex soldier with PTSD and learning how to be a civilian now that his tour of duty has been completed. They have been brought in to boost the security up now that Boone is hovering over the expecting Nina. Ella and Jake had one night together where Ella learned he was her mate but due to what happened with her mother she refuses to let Jake know so he is unaware that shifters exist yet he knows there is something about this group of ex soldiers. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely love Ms. Lowe's story telling she transports me away from my constant pain, lifts me from my depression and fills me with lots of warm fuzzies as once again I get to fall in love. There is plenty of action, drama, romance and passion to keep you enthralled and then you reach that last word and release a heart felt sigh. I voluntarily read an advance copy and have not been compensated in any way for this opinion but don't take my word for it grab a copy and judge for yourself I've a feeling you will be glad that you did.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2F9EOOMQGGWHD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:43508560":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":43508560,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":88,"name":"K Cram","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/43508560-k-cram","contributor":null,"id":43508560},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/43508560?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2269579026"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EiWlpPXSWr1A8tqWnwaJEQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.EiWlpPXSWr1A8tqWnwaJEQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:43508560"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1516742777586,"createdAt":1516742022689,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1516742776997,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eGreat Series!!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDragons, tigers, bears, foxes and more! Lure of the Fox is a wonderful conclusion to the Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart series. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake (human) and Ella (fox shifter) served in the military and had a night of passion that neither of them ever forgot. Ella knew that Jake was her mate, but Jake new nothing about shifters and Ella was not about to risk his life by initiating the mating bite. She couldn’t watch her mate die as her mother had. Human males don’t fare so well with the mating bite, as their bodies fight the change to hard.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen fate brings them together again to work at Koa Point providing security, will they be able to fight the mating pull that wants to bring them together? This story is filled with action, suspense and twists and turns, that ends up putting Jake and Ella in a life and death situation. But fate provides a very strong ally in a small spirit stone that just might be the answer to putting Ella’s fear to rest and allow her to have her happily ever after with her mate. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLoved Jake and Ella’s story, which also included the rest of the Koa Point team and the introduction to a couple little ones that make their entrance into the world.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI highly recommend this series. If you enjoy shifter stories with action, suspense and of course love, you will want to read each book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WTGIKJU1ZN91\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:144876149":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":144876149,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":73,"name":"Rmc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/144876149-rmc","contributor":null,"id":144876149},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144876149?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5519565116"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rVCZLXLuPBZN9Tg4ummgLg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rVCZLXLuPBZN9Tg4ummgLg","creator":{"__ref":"User:144876149"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1682832846849,"createdAt":1682832713289,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1682832846701,"text":"5/5*****. Lure of the Fox concludes the Jewels of the Heart shifter series, and gives the reader wonderful action, emotion, and passion. It was undeniably my favourite story of the series as it blended the Aloha Shifters and the Twin Moon Ranch shifters from Arizona. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eElla Kitt, desert fox shifter and Jake McBride, her former special forces teammate are reunited after 18 months when they are hired to provide security on a large estate on Koa Point in Maui. For Ella, Jake is the one-night stand she can't forget - he's also a human, totally off-limits to shifters of her kind.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“Kiss her, a little voice urged from the back of his mind.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eElla eased back, pulling him with her until he had her pinned against the wall. Her move, not his, like she wanted to surrender but didn’t know how.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHis pulse revved up into overdrive, and his nerves reported everything at once, drowning him in sensations. The tight grip of her arms. The heat of her chest. The desert rose scent of her hair. The burning need to hold her, countered by the fear of getting in way over his head.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJake looked at her, wishing he knew what he wanted to say. Stop resisting this, Ella? Or should he say, You’re right. We can’t let this happen? Whatever power was at work between them — destiny? Raw desire? — was beyond addictive, and he hated how it had overrode all his self-control.”","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AWFR25RVO10XB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41987669":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41987669,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1441572735i/41987669._UX200_CR0,16,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":2504,"name":"Toula","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41987669-toula","contributor":null,"id":41987669},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/41987669?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3117022661"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.HvY9BwXBXhIFCsUAv7x1Uw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.HvY9BwXBXhIFCsUAv7x1Uw","creator":{"__ref":"User:41987669"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1578524876759,"createdAt":1578524856084,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1578524876529,"text":"Audio book review \u003cbr /\u003eBook 6 in the series and last in the series . Anna has written a fantastic series full of action, each of the shifter has his/ her other back. Each in the series , the shifter recognizes their mate right away . \u003cbr /\u003eThis lady in the series Anna throws us a loop with a female shifter. \u003cbr /\u003eHeroine is Ella , the fox shifter. Hero is Jake. Both Ella and Jake have had one night together while serving. Ella knew that Jake was her mate but ...... Jake didn’t want to have a life , a shifters life . After they are let go from the service Ella goes back with the other shifters. Silas and the other shifters have one thing they need to finish . All the shifters thought there was only 5 stones to find , now they know there are 6 magical stones . That’s where Silas ( first in the series ) and the rest call in Jake . Jake served with them so they know him real well . The rest of the shifters decide to also play matchmaker, throw Ella and Jake together and hopefully Mother Earth will show both of them the way . \u003cbr /\u003eGrab the story and find out do they find the last of the stones , does Jake finally decide to claim Ella .\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKelsey Performance for this audio was great, voice is smooth, strong and smooth. like the rest of the series \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:115521710":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":115521710,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1598048059i/115521710._UX200_CR0,50,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":4,"textReviewsCount":210,"name":"Kiranna Travellyn","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/115521710-kiranna-travellyn","contributor":null,"id":115521710},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/115521710?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4589612992"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N1tkiBlvzijMsshN-K4Y6g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N1tkiBlvzijMsshN-K4Y6g","creator":{"__ref":"User:115521710"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1646498680892,"createdAt":1646498673476,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1646498680695,"text":"Oh my gosh, Ella is so adorable. My heart broke for her, as a female shifter she has it so much harder than the men. Her feisty yet very stubborn attitude is extremely refreshing, she's a woman who can hold her own. Then there's Jake, now he is absolutely gorgeous. Everything about him makes me swoon, he's strong, determined and a little unsure of himself when it comes to Ella. The two of them end of in several awkward predicaments, which had me rolling over laughing at their rotten luck. The way both of them tripped over each other, metaphorically speaking. There's also the rest of the guys, the constant teasing was so good. The storyline is really fun and exciting, exactly what I've come to love about Anna Lowe's books. All of her characters are interesting and different, I love every single one of them. It's very hard to pick a favourite because they all are amazing, and the way she describes the places sounds so incredible. Coha point really makes you wish you were there, sorry if I misspelled that. Between the way everything is described and switching perspectives, these are what I love so much with the authors writing. This series is absolutely amazing, the narrator does a wonderful job reading this beautiful story.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3LQL2BU5VZ069\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:60982463":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":60982463,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1477615290i/60982463.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":41,"name":"Barbara  Ewt","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/60982463-barbara-ewt","contributor":null,"id":60982463},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/60982463?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2242697029"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._WhF0u3LLkg2VFYE1YTkcA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._WhF0u3LLkg2VFYE1YTkcA","creator":{"__ref":"User:60982463"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515116243546,"createdAt":1515087746649,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515116242769,"text":"Anna Lowe has done it again. Lure of the Fox is the best of the Aloha Shifter Series. Ella is a desert fox who came to Kao Point to help her old Special Forces Team,all shifters, against Moira. Jake, a human, also comes to help. Ella and Jake have not seen each other in 18 months, since that one special night, but the sparks are still there. Ella knows he is her destined mate but can not be with him due to the matting bite. Jake almost gets hit by a car and 3 members of his old team. Before he can even think about it he has to go to a meeting with Silas, Alpha of the shifter group. Silas and Cassandra want the group to do security at their wedding reception. Jake and Ella agree to be married for \"real\" and go to the resort several days before the reception and pose as honeymooners. While acting as honeymooners the go to a fair. While there Jake finds a wooden puzzle box and buys it. When he asks the women what is inside she simply says Destiny. If you want to know more get this book and all the books of the Aloha Shifters Series. I am volunteering giving a review on a book gifted to me by the author with no obligation.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2UCGBBIKMSFN5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42385062":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42385062,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1589497157i/42385062._UY200_CR18,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":19,"textReviewsCount":2953,"name":"LeMiliere","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42385062-lemiliere","contributor":null,"id":42385062},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42385062?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2243041201"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ijc2exYeo1sJ_2_-wlgFyg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ijc2exYeo1sJ_2_-wlgFyg","creator":{"__ref":"User:42385062"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515130838131,"createdAt":1515099942000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515099989000,"text":"I have loved every book in this series, at the start I mistakenly thought there would be just five books one for each of the residents of Koa Point. Well as the guys have found their mates and acquired the five Spirit Stones they have decided there is a need for more protection for their mates and hopefully the children who will arrive in the future.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe first step in this new stage is to hire Ella, who was introduced into the series in the very first book when she helped Tessa escape and sent her to Koa Point. Ella knew all of the guys because she served with them in the military and this makes her perfect for their security plans. They also hire Jake who Ella recognises as her mate - but he's human, can she tell him? Will he accept that shifters exist and that if he and Ella get together he will become one?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOn top of all this Jake has his past contend with, will Ella and he manage to get together finally?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is a great addition to the series and although it can be read as a standalone I would definitely recommend reading them in order as you will get so much more from them.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:44544623":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":44544623,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":114,"name":"Sandy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/44544623-sandy","contributor":null,"id":44544623},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44544623?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2248766551"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pJucAhmcCLvJN7iJDAxZxA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pJucAhmcCLvJN7iJDAxZxA","creator":{"__ref":"User:44544623"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1515392540138,"createdAt":1515392387549,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1515392539341,"text":"￼\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSearchyour account\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Fox (Aloha Shifters: Jewels of the Heart) (Volume 6)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLure of the Fox(Aloha Shifters)By Anna Lowe\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBySandy Brazzelon January 5, 2018\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs always with Anna Lowe you get a well written, steamy romance with an excellent story and characters that make you wish they were real. If you have not read any other of the Aloha Shifter books, you get an exotic paradise as the location! But the real story is this group of exmilitary heros, and adding Ella heroines, keeping thing safe, finding the stones that bring supernatural power, finding love and standing strong. This is Ella and Jake's story. Ella is a fox shifter, Jake is a sexy military man she has severed several missions with, and one mission lead to one night of sexy fun that can never be repeated, or can it! Human Alpha males don't always survive the mating bite of a female shifter, so Ella won't tell Jake he is her mate, but this book is about Destiny and she will not be denied. So danger lurks, they stand Gaurd, but someone will not be happy till Jake is dead, and old enemies are still circling. Destiny is at play.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A12OFPR256SW0F\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.8xbsA-Fdwz8_y_4Pvhhw6g\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0}},"params":{"book_id":"36548440-lure-of-the-fox"},"query":{"book_id":"36548440-lure-of-the-fox"},"jwtToken":null,"dataSource":"Production","authContextParams":{"signedIn":false,"customerId":null,"legacyCustomerId":null,"role":"user"},"userAgentContextParams":{"isWebView":null},"userAgent":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/121.0.0.0 Safari/537.36","init